      "category": "List-item",
      "text": "(a) All for-hire vehicles and commuter vans licensed as such by the Taxi and Limousine Commission are authorized, for the duration of the emergency, to pick up passengers with or without prearrangement. This shall include but not be limited to the pickup of passengers by street hail.",
