      "text": "(b) All commuter vans licensed as such by the Taxi and Limousine Commission are authorized to operate outside of the geographical area set forth in their operation authorization, and are further authorized to accept and discharge passengers on streets which otherwise constitute bus routes and at points which otherwise constitute bus stops.",
